{{- /* The agent definition itself is only deployed on a machine that has Kiro. Ignoring it
       leaves it in the repo for the next machine that needs it, rather than deleting work
       that took a while to get right. Flipping use_kiro off later stops future deploys but
       won't remove an already-deployed copy — chezmoi leaves ignored paths alone. */}}
